OL,3,AUK minister urges social media firms to
OL,4,Aremove dangerous driving videos
OL,5,
OL,6,FDefence Minister Luke Pollard has
OL,7,Fcalled on social media companies to
OL,8,Fremove posts celebrating dangerous
OL,9,Fdriving, after a viral trend showing
OL,10,Fpeople going the wrong way down roads.
OL,12,FPollard told BBC Breakfast on Monday:
OL,13,F"Social media companies could take that
OL,14,Fdown today, adjust their algorithms so
OL,15,Fit's not celebrated."
OL,17,FTwo police officers died when a car
OL,18,Fgoing the wrong way down a dual
OL,19,Fcarriageway crashed into their vehicle
OL,20,Fnear Middlesbrough on Saturday. The
OL,21,Ffive passengers in the other car were
OL,22,Falso killed.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
