OL,3,AIran faces 'greatest financial
OL,4,Aoffensive ever', says US treasury
OL,5,Asecretary
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US treasury secretary has threated
OL,8,FIran with "the single greatest
OL,9,Ffinancial offensive ever", claiming the
OL,10,FUS-Israel war with Iran was "entering
OL,11,Fits endgame".
OL,13,FScott Bessent said the US would sever
OL,14,Fall economic ties with the country in
OL,15,F"an economic D-Day" and that any nation
OL,16,Fpartnering with Iran financially would
OL,17,Falso be isolated.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
